title: If you've already got Rust
pid: b4609d0d-6057-4bdd-b5cd-e352e7abbf0a
body: |2-
  Run =cargo run -- data/jeff/skgconfig.toml= (or use =bash/start-servers.sh=).
  This starts the Rust server, which writes its logs to
  =data/jeff/skgconfig.toml.running/START/=, START being the time it started.

  Now you can use the [[file:../elisp/skg-client.el][Emacs client]].
